  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An unearthly majesty surrounds you in a 10-foot Emanation. Whenever the Emanation enters the space of a creature you can see, and whenever a creature you can see enters it or ends its turn there, you can force that creature to make a Wisdom saving throw, no more than once per turn. On a failure, it takes 4d6 Psychic damage and has the &amp;Reference[prone apply=false]{Prone} condition, and you can push it up to 10 feet away; on a success, it takes half as much damage only.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
